[mod]
!mod <rapidTag> - request a server-side Rapid mod download (e.g. !mod dev-mods:underwater-afus). Normal users vote; privileged users may execute directly.
[modstatus]
!modstatus - privately return SPADS downloaded Rapid mods (not necessarily active in this battle).
[modactivate]
!modactivate - prepare one game wrapper with ALL successfully downloaded RapidMods and schedule a rehost. Requires privileged access.
